    "en": {
      "trackName": "Tank Duel Watch",
      "description": "Tank Duel Watch — Addictive Tank Battles on Apple Watch\n\nFast. Strategic. Addictive.\n\nTake aim and fire in intense turn-based tank battles built specifically for Apple Watch. Use the Digital Crown to control angle and power, factor in wind, and destroy terrain with every shot. Easy to play. Hard to master. Impossible to stop.\n\n-  WHY PLAYERS LOVE IT\n-  Crown-based aiming (feels amazing on Watch)\n-  Dynamic wind adds real strategy\n-  Destructible terrain every round\n-  Quick matches perfect for short sessions\n-  Skill-based gameplay that keeps you coming back\n\n GAME MODES\n- Play vs AI — Smart, human-like opponents\n- Local Play — Battle a friend on one watch\n- Online Matches — Challenge friends anywhere\n\n BUILT FOR APPLE WATCH\nDesigned specifically for watchOS:\nSmooth crown controls\nClean, readable UI\nHaptic feedback for every shot\nInstant, pick-up-and-play gameplay\n\nCOMPETE & IMPROVE\n- Master angle, power, and timing\n- Adapt to wind and terrain\n- Learn from every shot\n- Climb your way to victory",
